    "roles": ["band_member", "touring", "educator", "clinician"],
    "summary": "Spanish drummer from Valencia, Jorge Garrido, known online as El Estepario Siberiano: the most-followed drummer in Spain by 2020 and one of the most watched anywhere, for drum covers played his own way, one-handed grooves, speed on a single pedal and grooves built a limb at a time on short videos. He took lessons as a boy, played in dance-band orchestras, then shared videos full time from the 2020 lockdown. Saratoga's drummer 2020-2023, then Residente's touring drummer and the Cost's. His influences for one-pedal playing are gospel-chops drummers: Thomas Pridgen, Tony Royster Jr., Eric Moore, Chris Coleman, and Spain's Miguel Lamas."
  },
